{"id":"wb-3-60","name":"平遥城墙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"平遥城墙","text":"平遥城墙位于山西省中部的平遥县，是中国现存最完整的古代城墙。1988年，平遥城墙被中华人民共和国国务院公布为第三批全国重点文物保护单位之一。1997年，包括平遥城墙在内的平遥古城被列入世界遗产名录。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B9%B3%E9%81%A5%E5%9F%8E%E5%A2%99","revisionId":95309987,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95309987","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d7eb1a1cfb6c831ea6656a24.jpg","title":"PingYaoCityWall.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:PingYaoCityWall.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/PingYaoCityWall.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Peellden","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"​平遙城牆，中國山西。","width":320,"height":213}}